Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:03.33,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,在遊樂場過七夕？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:04.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,對！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:09.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那間遊樂場常有小孩子去 所以就決定辦那種活動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.66,0:00:13.77,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,不過莉莉 妳知道七夕是什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.77,0:00:14.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:18.78,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,是織女和牛郎一年只能見一次面的日子對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:21.53,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好浪漫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.17,Top,Sheryl,0,0,0,,妳冷靜一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:23.49,Top,Sheryl,0,0,0,,盤子會破掉啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:28.41,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,為了紀念他們 要把對喜歡的人許的願望寫在短冊上對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:30.59,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:33.26,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,總之先來洗盤子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:36.89,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,嗯？ 對喜歡的人許的願望？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:40.38,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,日本的七夕是這樣的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:52.46,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我還以為短冊會掛得更隱密一點 讓人看不見呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:55.65,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,日本人的心臟都這麼大顆嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯？ 莉莉妳怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:00:59.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嚇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:03.42,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那… 那個… 大家在短冊上寫了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.68,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯… 雖然有點不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:08.80,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:13.32,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我寫得還滿實際的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,加賀同學寫了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,職業玩家！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:22.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳居然是認真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:25.05,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:29.06,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我是心懷天下而寫下的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:34.56,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這是身為班長理所當然的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:39.00,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那莉莉妳寫了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:42.45,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那… 那個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 什麼東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是誰的短冊掉下來了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:55.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:59.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這… 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:04.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,你… 你看到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.79,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃… 這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.44,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司你這個笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:10.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊！ 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.66,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,總而言之 夏天來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.99,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,時序進入七月下旬…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:57.08,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,引頸期盼的暑假終於來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:09.44,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,暑假第一天 遊樂場一如往常地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:12.54,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,擠滿了熱愛遊戲的孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:19.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,就算放暑假 我們還是照常來遊樂場報到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,要先玩什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:23.65,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊 是妳們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:26.66,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.01,Text,Aoi & Lily,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:31.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 妳們兩個都來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:34.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,畢竟是暑假嘛 好好玩個夠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:38.91,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,望月同學 有什麼不懂的隨時都可以問喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:40.67,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,不用客氣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:43.67,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好的！ 非常謝謝你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.08,Text,Part-timers,0,0,0,,心動！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:51.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,喂 哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:54.84,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,為什麼那位大姊姊會在這裡工作啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:57.38,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 那是因為啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她好像在找學校附近排班又有彈性的打工
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:04.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她問我這裡怎麼樣 我就介紹她來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.90,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,你這笨蛋哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我為什麼被罵了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.46,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,因為你是木頭啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:16.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她本來就是莉莉戀愛之路上的頭號勁敵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:20.01,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,大學和職場都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這下子被她佔了極大的優勢…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.42,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我也想在這裡工作…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.42,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I want to work here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:27.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:29.66,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳還是國中生 不能打工吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:30.85,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,但…！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.66,0:05:30.85,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,But…!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒有但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:38.23,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,能這麼自然地聽懂英文 好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:41.97,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我也是大學生 得好好加油才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:44.27,Text,Customer,0,0,0,,那個 店員！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.27,0:05:45.73,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是！ 來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:48.42,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,望月同學 這裡交給妳可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:49.30,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:52.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:06:00.12,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,之前那場女人之間的戰爭又要開始了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.34,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,得好好溝通才行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.89,High,Lily,0,0,0,,這裡不乾淨
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.89,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,This isn't clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.63,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,婆… 婆婆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:15.06,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊 對… 對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.13,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我立刻清理乾淨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.56,High,Lily,0,0,0,,那裡也是
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.56,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:19.85,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,是… 是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.06,High,Lily,0,0,0,,那裡也是！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.06,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:23.34,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我知道了！ 前輩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:25.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她不是妳前輩啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:34.15,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我也來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:35.41,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:37.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.17,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我… 我也會加油的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我一定要贏過桃子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.12,High,Lily,0,0,0,,妳做得很好
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.12,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,You do quite good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.49,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我准許你在這裡工作！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.49,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll permit you to work here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:58.10,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,謝… 謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:07:00.47,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,完全把自己當前輩了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:04.34,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哇 好厲害！ 變得閃閃發亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:05.86,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:09.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,有空的時候就先打掃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:12.75,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,第一天就確實掌握基本功 真可靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.11,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,謝謝你 草壁同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:19.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.61,0:07:19.37,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Renji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.58,High,Lily,0,0,0,,也稱讚我一下！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.58,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Praise me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？ 為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:24.25,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,謝謝您！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:26.66,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,這也是多虧了前輩的指導！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯哼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,所以說為什麼啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哇 好多小孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,他們在玩什麼遊戲啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:42.91,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,啊 那個是「閃舞」喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:44.84,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,閃舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.87,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,對 「閃舞」就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:50.16,Text,Girl A,0,0,0,,咦 姊姊們不知道「閃舞」嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.68,Text,Girl A; Girl B,0,0,0,,就是「閃亮女孩熱舞」！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.16,Text,Girl B,0,0,0,,通稱「閃舞」！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:57.45,Text,Girl A,0,0,0,,用卡片幫自己的角色搭配造型來玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:08:01.03,Text,Girl A,0,0,0,,是現在女孩子之間最受歡迎的節奏遊戲喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:05.92,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哼… 就算說是受歡迎 也是給小孩子玩的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:09.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我們都已經是國中生了 那種東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:15.31,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,竟然已經去排隊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.76,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,姊姊 妳要玩下一場嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:18.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:25.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這個要怎麼用？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:29.61,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦… 這個嘛… 我也沒玩過…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.94,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,首先要掃描卡片喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.36,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,姊姊們是第一次玩嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.76,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.32,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,真拿妳們沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.66,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,我的最強套裝借妳們用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:43.32,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:47.24,Text,Part-timer A & Part-timer B,0,0,0,,是… 是幼女前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.59,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,要配合音樂按下按鈕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.56,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好… 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:55.18,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,不是那樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:58.40,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,啊！ 那裡要擺出特別姿勢才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:00.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,特… 特別…？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:03.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說起來 莉莉不擅長玩音遊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.60,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,啊啊… 好可惜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.07,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,真拿妳沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.27,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,姊姊 妳可以再玩一次喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:17.16,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,在一旁守護到妳過關為止
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.86,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,是身為前輩的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.87,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,前… 前輩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:26.89,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,那麼 總之先投錢拿卡片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:27.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:33.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:35.32,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,男子漢無尾熊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:37.22,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,這… 這張卡片是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:40.81,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,「男子漢無尾熊」合作限定的飾品！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:43.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這隻無尾熊還真會到處出現呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:48.77,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,好！ 用我這套無尾熊套裝的話 應該就是最強的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:50.48,High,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎！？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.48,0:09:50.48,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.65,High,Lily,0,0,0,,好… 好可愛…！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.65,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,S-So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.83,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,跟剛才完全不一樣耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.86,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,妳在那一瞬間就成長了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:12.12,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,男子漢無尾熊的力量好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.00,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,特別姿勢也成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:17.31,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:21.01,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,用很高的分數過關了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:22.01,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,恭喜！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:22.85,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝妳！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.01,0:10:22.85,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:23.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,前輩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.82,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,太棒了 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:29.15,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:34.68,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,我只有無尾熊的飾品還沒拿到 所以沒用過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:37.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,給妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:38.95,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:41.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這張卡片送妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.29,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,當作今天的謝禮！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.96,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,咦！？ 妳要送我嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:48.64,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 因為我是大姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:52.67,Text,Nana,0,0,0,,我去問媽媽可不可以收！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,看她那麼高興…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:59.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過莉莉真了不起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:01.55,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,明明自己也很想要…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:07.38,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,竟然已經又去排隊 想再拿一張了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:16.77,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳果然在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.77,0:11:17.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:19.74,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:20.94,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:23.52,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,去買東西順路就過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:27.94,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,我也一直想來這裡玩一次看看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.71,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,喔不！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.71,Text-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:34.54,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,這些東西要怎麼放進去啊？？ 我不明白！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.96,0:11:34.54,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Just how do these things go in?? I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.96,High,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽 妳做得到的！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.96,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Mom, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:39.53,Top,Sheryl,0,0,0,,不行 我做不到！ 我不知道怎麼辦！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.96,0:11:39.53,Top-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,No, I can't! I don't known what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉的遊戲天分…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.90,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,妳要按這個按鈕！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.90,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,You should press this button!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:43.22,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,看來是遺傳自媽媽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.92,Top,Sheryl,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.92,Top-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:48.74,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,果然像我這種機械白痴 是沒有辦法享受遊戲的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.74,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,沒問題的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:51.73,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.81,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,就算不玩遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:56.60,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,這裡也有能讓您樂在其中的東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:03.55,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,哦 樓下也有遊戲機啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:04.60,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,拍貼機！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:07.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,之前和葵衣她們一起拍過 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:09.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯！ 很好玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:13.62,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 對啊 拍貼機的話 不擅長玩遊戲的人也能樂在其中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:14.83,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:18.87,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,而且這裡也有提供 Cosplay 用的服裝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:22.19,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,不過這種不是年輕女孩子在玩的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:25.38,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,像我這種阿姨來玩 好像有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.26,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,不不不！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:31.21,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,最近也有很多學生帶媽媽一起來拍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:33.31,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,一點都不奇怪喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:36.52,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,Cosplay 拍照是很好的紀念喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:40.86,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,是嗎？ 既然妳都這麼說了 那我也來試試看好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:43.00,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,好啊 請務必試試看！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,明明是打工第一天…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:48.66,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這麼積極的望月同學還真少見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:51.14,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽 我們一起拍吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.40,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,怎… 怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳們兩個都很適合喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:00.90,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,很棒呢！ 親子旗袍！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:05.43,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,可以稍微擺個像拳法那樣的姿勢嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:07.67,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,這… 這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:11.92,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊啊！ 好！ 很棒呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:15.03,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那我們就趕快來拍貼吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:16.82,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,來吧 來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:19.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,總覺得她好像打開了什麼奇怪的開關
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:21.45,Top,Print Club Machine,0,0,0,,好 要拍囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:24.11,Top,Print Club Machine,0,0,0,,3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:36.66,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,拍了好多張呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:41.55,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊啊 非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.89,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,因為我非常喜歡 Cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:47.46,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,幫適合的人換上衣服 就會興奮到忘我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:49.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原來是這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.38,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,沒關係 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:55.30,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,就像妳說的 成了很棒的紀念
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:59.44,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,是說 我終於明白妳為什麼這麼喜歡來遊樂場了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.39,0:13:59.44,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Besides, I finally understand why you love arcades so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.90,High,Lily,0,0,0,,很棒吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.90,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Aren't they great?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:05.28,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,哇啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:09.11,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,喂 我們也來拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,之後再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.96,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,我還會再來玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.04,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,謝謝光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:25.17,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,這照片是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:29.06,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,啊 那個啊 今天和莉莉一起去遊樂場…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:35.88,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,竟敢讓我的妻女穿上這種不正經的服裝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:37.85,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你這臭小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:42.17,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:47.55,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,為什麼沒有也約我一起去啊 媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:48.65,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,居然是那個原因嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:52.16,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,好了 別鬧彆扭了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.66,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,下次我們大家一起拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:57.35,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:14.93,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,今天遊樂場也一如往常地擠滿了熱愛遊戲的客人們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:20.43,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,然而 有時候也會有比較特別的人造訪…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.83,High,Jody,0,0,0,,打擾一下！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.83,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:23.93,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:29.03,High,Jody,0,0,0,,我想請問一件事 妳有空嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.69,0:15:29.03,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,I want to ask you something. Do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.83,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,啊！ 是外國人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:34.25,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,得… 得好好接待才行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.20,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,哈… 哈囉…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.98,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請… 請… 請問…
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.98,Text-English,Momoko,0,0,0,,May…May…May I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:39.95,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:42.11,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那個… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:44.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,望月同學 交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:46.72,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,草壁同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:48.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:51.21,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我不是一直都能和莉莉溝通嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:52.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,請問有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.40,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:57.27,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,我是從澳洲來的
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.35,0:15:57.27,Text-English,Jody,0,0,0,,I'm here from Australia
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:16:01.52,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,我弟弟要我帶一些日本最受歡迎的角色商品回去
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.27,0:16:01.52,Text-English,Jody,0,0,0,,and my brother asked me to get some goods of the most popular character in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.34,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,你知道可能是哪個角色嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.34,Text-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Do you know which character that might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.36,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,如果你能幫我的話就太好了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.36,Text-English,Jody,0,0,0,,If you could help me out, that would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:08.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,請… 請稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:14.67,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,說得太快了 我聽不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:17.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,明明莉莉說的話我大多都聽得懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,怎麼了？ 蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:22.15,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:26.74,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 我聽不懂客人的英文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:29.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,原來如此 交給我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.13,High,Lily,0,0,0,,不好意思 請問有什麼問題嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.13,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Excuse me. What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.80,High,Jody,0,0,0,,嗯 正如妳所見...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.80,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Yeah, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.26,High,Jody,0,0,0,,我是從澳洲過來玩的
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.26,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,I'm on holiday from Australia
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:41.06,High,Jody,0,0,0,,我弟弟要我帶一些日本最受歡迎的角色商品回去...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.26,0:16:39.47,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,and my little brother asked me to bring back something
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.47,0:16:41.06,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,with the most popular character in Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.23,High,Jody,0,0,0,,妳可以幫我嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.23,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,and I want you guys to help me out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:44.98,High,Lily,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.10,0:16:44.98,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.39,High,Lily,0,0,0,,妳一定找得到的！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.39,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I think you'll definitely find something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:49.66,High,Lily,0,0,0,,這裡有很多角色供妳選擇
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.39,0:16:49.66,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,There are just so many characters to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.36,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,得救了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:52.43,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好厲害 她在說英文耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:50.89,Top,Jody,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.66,0:16:50.89,Top-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:52.96,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,如果妳需要的話 我可以幫妳找
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.89,0:16:52.96,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,If you want, I can help you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:54.16,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這不是當然的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:56.24,Top,Jody,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 那真是幫了大忙！順帶一提 我叫喬蒂
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.96,0:16:56.24,Top-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Thank you. That would be a huge help! I'm Jody, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:56.97,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,畢竟莉莉同學是英國人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.61,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,我是莉莉·貝卡
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.61,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm Lily Baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:58.28,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:59.16,Top,Jody,0,0,0,,很高興認識妳 莉莉！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.61,0:16:59.16,Top-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過因為平常都跟她很自然地聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:02.91,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,總覺得都忘了這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:04.81,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,說的也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:09.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉的表情很豐富 還會用肢體語言跟我溝通
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:15.65,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,而且她也很體貼 盡量不用太長的句子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:19.38,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,最近用日文跟我說話的次數也變多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.80,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我知道了 蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:24.14,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這位是喬蒂小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.22,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,她說她是從澳洲來的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:30.56,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,她好像想要日本受歡迎的角色周邊商品！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:33.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原來如此… 角色周邊商品啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:34.83,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那還用說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:38.83,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,肯定是格鬥遊戲的角色吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:41.79,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,哦！ 太棒了！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.39,0:17:41.79,Text-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Oh, fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:45.55,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,對吧？ 我可是把命都賭在這傢伙身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:48.22,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好！ 小哥 來跟我一決勝負！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.04,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,就說我還在打工！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.34,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說到現在流行的人氣角色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,當然是「閃舞」吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:58.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,妳不是才說那是給小孩子玩的遊戲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:03.20,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,昨天看莉莉妳在玩 就產生興趣了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.42,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.85,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,現在人多到爆了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:13.32,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我強力推薦猜謎遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:15.32,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,不僅考驗智力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.41,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,也需要團隊合作和反應神經
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:20.70,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這才是終極的遊戲！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:21.83,Text,Jody,0,0,0,,哦…！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:27.06,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,終極是沒錯啦 但猜謎遊戲是日文 她應該看不懂吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:29.77,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,而且根本已經和角色無關了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.59,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,既然如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:37.58,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,就只有男子漢無尾熊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:39.15,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.67,High,Jody,0,0,0,,真可愛！
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.67,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:46.18,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,喬蒂小姐是澳洲人 所以對無尾熊應該很熟悉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:48.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這… 這麼說也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:50.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:54.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉該不會是考慮到這點 才推薦男子漢無尾熊的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:19:00.11,High,Lily,0,0,0,,還有！ 當無尾熊先生戴上太陽眼鏡時 他的男子漢模式就啟動了！
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.90,0:19:00.11,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,And when this Mr. Koala wears sunglasses, then his otokogi mode starts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:03.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不 應該不可能吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.38,Text,Aoi & Hotaru & Karin,0,0,0,,嗯嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.96,High,Jody,0,0,0,,妳真的很喜歡這個角色呢
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.96,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,You really like this character, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.54,High,Lily,0,0,0,,對啊！ 最喜歡了！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.54,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yup! I adore him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:16.30,High,Jody,0,0,0,,那我想… 他也是吧
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.27,0:19:16.30,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Then I think he'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:19.92,High,Jody,0,0,0,,但我不知道怎麼拿到他
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.13,0:19:19.92,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,I really have no idea how to get him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:23.24,High,Lily,0,0,0,,包在我身上！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.97,0:19:23.24,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:25.14,Text,Aoi & Hotaru & Karin & Renji,0,0,0,,哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:31.56,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我覺得我好像夾不起來耶…！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.39,0:19:31.56,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Honestly, I just can't seem to move him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.48,High,Lily,0,0,0,,抱歉 喬蒂！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.48,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Jody, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.02,High,Jody,0,0,0,,呃 看起來真難…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.02,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Well, it does seem hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:38.92,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我會加油的！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.31,0:19:38.92,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll keep trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:42.44,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真是的 看不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:44.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我們也去幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:46.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:51.82,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這個配置的話 或許瞄準後面比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:53.42,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊 原來如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.92,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那樣的話 選那個娃娃比較好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對對 那傢伙是目標
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:10.68,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,夾到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.60,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,太棒了 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:14.19,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,總算夾到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.00,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真不愧是妳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:19.95,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我學到了永不放棄的心情有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:21.15,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,來！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.90,High,Jody,0,0,0,,謝謝妳！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.90,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.94,High,Jody,0,0,0,,妳喜歡他 對吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.94,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,You fancy him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:33.92,High,Lily,0,0,0,,什… 什麼？ 呃…
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.74,0:20:33.92,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Wh-What? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.71,High,Jody,0,0,0,,如果妳願意的話我可以給妳一些建議
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.71,High-English,Jody,0,0,0,,I can give you advice, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.97,High,Lily,0,0,0,,真… 真的嗎！？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.97,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,R-Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.17,Top,Jody,0,0,0,,是喔
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.17,Top-English,Jody,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.85,Top,Jody,0,0,0,,妳最近為了更接近他都做了些什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.85,Top-English,Jody,0,0,0,,What have you been doing lately to get closer to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:42.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她們在聊什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.69,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,我一直有在寫信給他
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.69,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I've been writing him letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:47.59,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我也必須更努力學習英文才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:55.80,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,遊樂場似乎也是一個結交新朋友的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:01.72,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:02.23,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗚哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.48,0:21:06.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 歡迎光臨…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.87,0:21:10.24,Top,Oliver,0,0,0,,我在莉莉的房間裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:13.00,Top,Oliver,0,0,0,,當然是完全偶然發現的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:14.62,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:18.08,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你果然一直在玩弄我女兒的感情嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:21.51,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 啊 不是… 這個是… 伯父…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:28.21,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你… 你… 你這傢伙根本沒有資格叫我「伯父」！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:29.47,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.14,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真是的 爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:33.48,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,不要擅自進我的房間！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.79,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:39.30,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,可是爸爸很擔心莉莉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:40.73,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,真是的 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:43.21,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,我們今天來這裡不是為了這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:43.80,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗚…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.23,0:21:45.98,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:46.87,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:52.19,Top,Print Club Machine,0,0,0,,好 要拍囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:55.98,Top,Print Club Machine,0,0,0,,3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:22:03.25,Text,Narrator,0,0,0,,於是 在遊樂場的快樂時光 今後也將繼續下去
